[00:06.19]1. Jehovah, dear Father,
[00:12.38]There seemed no hope for us.
[00:27.55]The ransom has given
[00:36.55]Hope to ev’ryone!
[00:44.55]We give our lives to you,
[01:08.25]Our best in all we do.
[01:17.25]And we’ll tell others too,
[01:26.78]That your will might be done.
[01:35.78](Chorus)
[01:43.78]You gave your precious Son,
[01:49.15]And now we sing as one,
[01:53.76]A song we’ll sing forever,
[01:58.27]for giving us your precious Son.
[02:03.38]2. Your kindness, your mercy,
[02:08.50]They draw us close to you.
[02:13.62]Your great name, your friendship,
[02:18.73]These we’ve come to love.
[02:23.85]But something more than this
[02:28.97]Is your most precious gift.
[02:34.09]He died that we might live.
[02:39.20]You sent him from above.
[02:44.32](Chorus)
[02:49.44]You gave your precious Son,
[02:52.44]And now we sing as one,
[02:57.44]A song we’ll sing forever,
[03:02.44]for giving us your precious Son.
[03:07.41](Ending)
[03:12.38]Jehovah, dear Father, we pray in gratitude.
[03:21.38]We offer our thanks for giving us your precious Son.